      "value": "i think vrchat should boost their age requirement to atleast 16+ because i think that with alot of the content and topics on vrchat it would make since to boost the age from 13 to 16+ for the main content  and as for nsfw content we should add policies and filters that protect underage users so they cant see or access the nsfw content unless they are age verified 18+  or add a policy allowing age verified users to use nsfw content  in age verified instances or private instances so that people who are in 18+ verified worlds can feel free to host nsfw content in their respected age restricted worlds i think this would be the better way to go because persons at the age of 13 are very impressionable and shouldnt beable to use vrchat so boosting the base content to 16+ and boosting the nsfw content to 18+ and adding security measures to make sure under age users dont have access to the nsfw content  would be the best way to improve vrchat as a whole",
