      "value": "Yeah, exactly what I just stated in my Poll about 18+ worlds and avatars. Right now very communities get hit hard that're kinky, but what's happening in VRC? Most visited worlds are night clubs with people drinking and having sex in public worlds (on locked rooms inside those, but still), while very light suggestive kink content gets completely erased during the last weeks. It would be nice, if they'd put that energy in NSFW tags or other 18+ filtering...",
